/*
 * HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Distance Measurement — Raspberry Pi 4 Model B
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   TRIG -> GPIO 23 (physical pin 16, BCM 23, output)
 *   ECHO -> GPIO 24 (physical pin 18, BCM 24, input, pull-down)
 *   NOTE: The HC-SR04 ECHO pin outputs 5 V; use a voltage divider
 *         (e.g. 1 kΩ / 2 kΩ) or a level shifter to bring it down to
 *         the Raspberry Pi's 3.3 V GPIO tolerance.
 *
 * Build:
 *   gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o hcsr04 hcsr04.c -lgpiod
 */

